                    {
                        "title": "International Innovation Technology Expo (IITE) 2026 Presents MSMEs Awards as a Platform for Appreciation and Innovation in Solo Raya MSMEs",
                        "date": "22 Juli 2026",
                        "category": "MSMEs",
                        "summary": "The MSMEs Awards 2026, held as part of the International Innovation Technology Expo (IITE) 2026, featured presentations from ten selected MSME finalists from Solo Raya. Evaluated by experts from the Surakarta Government and the Indonesian MSME Association (APMI) Soloraya, the event aims to recognize innovation, strengthen partnerships, and encourage sustainable growth among local businesses. During the opening session, IITE 2026 Chair Dr. Prasiwi Citra Resmi emphasized the importance of cross-sector collaboration in addressing global challenges and fostering innovation-driven development.",
                        "image": "/uploads/1784693579_Screenshot_2026-07-22_102755.jpg",
                        "slug": "international-innovation-technology-expo-iite-2026-presents-msmes-awards-as-a-platform-for-appreciation-and-innovation-in-solo-raya-msmes",
                        "content": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\">Surakarta, July 22, 2026 \u2013 The\n2026 International Innovation Technology Expo (IITE) officially kicked off on\nJuly 22, 2026, with the MSMEs (UMKM) Awards 2026, a platform for appreciating\nand developing innovation for Micro, Small, and Medium Enterprises (MSMEs) in\nthe Solo Raya region. IITE 2026, held on July 22, 23, and 30, 2026, featured a\ndiverse agenda that brought together academics, industry players, government,\nand the community to encourage innovation and collaboration.<o:p></o:p></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\">The opening session began with\npresentations from the 10 finalist MSMEs that had gone through a selection\nprocess. Participants presented their business profiles, product innovations,\nbusiness development strategies, and their potential contributions to improving\nlocal economic competitiveness. Through this activity, the organizers hope to\nprovide MSMEs with a space to showcase their creativity, expand their networks,\nand receive input from practitioners and stakeholders.<o:p></o:p></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\">The judging process was conducted\nby two judges with expertise in MSME empowerment: Gembong Hadi Wibowo, S.Psi.,\nM.Si., Head of MSME Empowerment and Development at the Surakarta City\nCooperatives, SMEs, and Industry Office, and Zakki Riyan Isnaini, S.T., a\nrepresentative from the Solo Raya branch of the Indonesian Micro, Small, and\nMedium Enterprises Association (APMI). The assessment focused on innovation,\nbusiness sustainability, market development potential, and the added value of\neach product.<o:p></o:p></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\">The Chair of the International\nInnovation Technology Expo (IITE) 2026, Dr. Prasiwi Citra Resmi, S.Par.,\nM.Par., emphasized in her remarks that cross-sector collaboration is key to\nfacing increasingly complex global challenges. According to him, IITE 2026 is\nnot only a competition but also a shared space to build synergy between the\ngovernment, business, academia, and the community.<o:p></o:p></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\">\"Collaboration across\nvarious sectors is crucial today. We hope this event can provide a space for\nexchanging knowledge, strengthening partnerships, and formulating real\nsolutions to address various global challenges. With a spirit of collaboration,\nwe can grow and develop together,\" said Dr. Prasiwi Citra Resmi.<o:p></o:p></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\">Through the 2026 MSMEs Awards,\nIITE hopes to encourage new innovations from MSMEs, increase the\ncompetitiveness of local products, and strengthen a sustainable entrepreneurial\necosystem. This event also demonstrates IITE 2026's commitment to supporting innovation-\nand collaboration-based economic growth for inclusive and globally competitive\ndevelopment (-<b><i>MA Tyas-</i></b>).<o:p></o:p></p>",
                        "additionalImages": [],
